cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or the CNVS MTC Technical Report, please cite it as below."
title: "CNVS MTC Data Room: Monte Carlo Test Suite and Executable Evaluation Environment for Closed Native Verification Systems"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Comitato"
    given-names: "Massimo"
year: 2026
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-08"
abstract: >-
  The CNVS MTC Data Room contains the Monte Carlo Test Suite, executable
  evaluation environments, interactive dashboards, engineering-hardening tests,
  figures, reports, and provenance material for the Closed Native Verification
  Systems (CNVS) framework. The suite provides numerical, projective,
  interactive, empirical, and executable support under explicit CNVS assumptions.
  It does not replace the formal proof of the CNVS theory and does not establish
  unconditional security.
keywords:
  - CNVS
  - Closed Native Verification Systems
  - Monte Carlo simulation
  - Global Veto
  - distributed verification
  - hidden invariant binding
  - finite-field validation
  - protocol engineering
  - adversarial reconstruction
  - stochastic testing
